dict(u='pregnant-1wz20ie',speaker=E,stage='first_trimester',type='others_said',themes=['own_mother','announcement','living_abroad'],quote="Shortly after we told them, she said: \"Then I expect regular FaceTime calls if you are so far away.\" My mother-in-law had said shortly before, laughing, that she has a request she would like to make, namely that she gets pictures on the weekend - two worlds apart, especially in how it was said.",context='12 weeks, telling her mother and in-laws together on holiday; she lives abroad.'),
